  "name": "Maqam Bayati on D (24-EDO): D E1/2b F G A Bb C",
  "notes": "Maqam Bayati on D (24-EDO): D E1/2b F G A Bb C -- 24-EDO scale mask over the shared 24-quarter-tone tuning. Transposable. || Cent values after Sami Abu Shumays' maqam presets for Ableton Live 12 (tuning.ableton.com/arabic-maqam). Egypt/Greater Syria practice; one practitioner's deeply-informed version, NOT a universal standard. Maqam identity is melodic, not just the scale."
